WEBVTT

00:00:02.383 --> 00:00:05.182
Candy, who grieved over Anthony's death,

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:09.047
...managed to regain her vigor
with Jimmy's help.

00:00:12.002 --> 00:00:16.287
And Candy decided that she would live
strongly from that point on.

00:00:20.874 --> 00:00:25.070
A present of angels.

00:00:41.778 --> 00:00:44.400
The Christmas day draws near.

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:24.684
What a big tree!

00:01:25.086 --> 00:01:28.891
Mr. Cartwright sent you
a very good tree indeed!

00:01:29.415 --> 00:01:31.347
It was from mr. Cartwright?

00:01:31.961 --> 00:01:35.855
Yeah. Since it's your last Christmas here,
you deserve a nice big tree...

00:01:36.643 --> 00:01:38.250
Last Christmas?

00:01:40.089 --> 00:01:44.901
Uh... Could you talk to mr. Cartwright...

00:01:45.235 --> 00:01:51.696
Cowboys manage everything instead of him.
So you'd better tell it directly to them.

00:01:57.686 --> 00:02:01.843
Sister Pony, what did he mean
by "last Christmas"?

00:02:01.878 --> 00:02:07.516
Uh.. it's nothing.
Now, everyone, let's take the tree inside!

00:02:25.123 --> 00:02:28.340
Santa Claus will be so surprised
when he sees this tree!

00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:31.183
Yeah, he's gonna dump a whole
lot of presents on us!

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.500
I wonder will he be able to
put a present in here...

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:38.042
-Don't worry, just put another one!
-Okay, I'll do that!

00:02:38.565 --> 00:02:42.272
Candy, borrow me your socks!
They are probably the largest here!

00:02:42.484 --> 00:02:44.624
Oh, John!

00:02:48.989 --> 00:02:52.247
Sister Pony, the children are
so cheerful...

00:02:52.631 --> 00:02:55.176
Who knows where they'll be next year...

00:02:57.156 --> 00:02:59.435
Just a little bit more...

00:03:04.002 --> 00:03:06.241
They are hiding something from us.

00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:09.507
I'm sure there is a reason Sister Pony
is so worried.

00:03:16.107 --> 00:03:20.073
-Why didn't mr. Cartwright listen to us?
-Cartwright?

00:03:22.044 --> 00:03:25.756
It's impossible to get to him...
with his cowboys guarding the gate...

00:03:26.632 --> 00:03:30.783
Anyway, he'll let us stay here
until the spring, right?

00:03:31.063 --> 00:03:32.462
It makes no sense!

00:03:32.497 --> 00:03:36.664
He saw us collecting donations,
and then suddenly came up with this idea!

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:44.361
But it's his land, after all...
And if he wants to extend his farm...

00:03:44.594 --> 00:03:49.938
Sister Pony, we should try one more time
to see Mr. Cartwright and to speak to him.

00:03:50.136 --> 00:03:53.247
Yes, we'll go after Christmas...

00:03:54.703 --> 00:03:59.748
It's... Pony's home is going to disappear!
Then...

00:04:00.762 --> 00:04:03.706
Yeah. Since it's your last Christmas here,
you deserve a nice big tree...

00:04:03.741 --> 00:04:05.954
...because it's your last Christmas here.

00:04:07.007 --> 00:04:09.934
No...
This can't be happening!

00:04:13.854 --> 00:04:15.676
Jimmy! Where are you, Jimmy!

00:04:17.997 --> 00:04:19.332
I'm here, boss!

00:04:19.514 --> 00:04:20.730
Come here!

00:04:22.403 --> 00:04:24.716
Did I do something...?

00:04:33.535 --> 00:04:35.312
Jimmy, how old are you?

00:04:35.712 --> 00:04:37.381
I'm seven year old...

00:04:38.654 --> 00:04:41.628
Alright. You're old enough then.

00:04:42.026 --> 00:04:45.301
I'm an adult. Okay? Now we're
going to have an adult-to-adult talk.

00:04:57.955 --> 00:05:03.491
So that's how it is, dammit!
I'm gonna kick that Cartwright's ass!

00:05:03.492 --> 00:05:06.292
That's right, because he wants
to kick us out!

00:05:06.327 --> 00:05:09.665
Huh? Jimmy? Jimmy!

00:05:10.899 --> 00:05:11.800
I'm here!

00:05:12.636 --> 00:05:16.621
-Boss!
-Geez, you sure fell in!

00:05:24.377 --> 00:05:29.057
Anyway, we'll first try to talk
to him in a civilized manner!

00:05:29.433 --> 00:05:31.251
Yup, in a civilized manner!

00:05:31.631 --> 00:05:34.885
And if that doesn't work,
we'll use the force!

00:05:35.311 --> 00:05:36.297
Okay!

00:05:44.581 --> 00:05:45.522
It's here.

00:05:50.206 --> 00:05:52.465
Boss, this house is scary.

00:05:52.884 --> 00:05:55.489
You're an adult, aren't you?
Pull yourself together!

00:05:55.524 --> 00:05:56.674
I'm okay now!

00:05:57.202 --> 00:06:01.721
He already owns such a big house, why does
he need the land where Pony's home is?

00:06:01.931 --> 00:06:03.637
That's right!

00:06:03.918 --> 00:06:05.080
Now, let's go!

00:06:13.732 --> 00:06:15.635
We'll try the main doors first.

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:18.915
If that doesn't work out, we'll have to
look around for him a bit.

00:06:21.106 --> 00:06:22.498
HEY!!!

00:06:27.808 --> 00:06:29.394
What are you two?

00:06:29.949 --> 00:06:32.540
Uh... we're looking for mr. Cartwright...

00:06:32.713 --> 00:06:37.329
I'm in charge of all the cowboys here.
What business do you have with mr. Cartwright?

00:06:37.993 --> 00:06:40.626
We'd like to talk to
mr. Cartwright directly...

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.735
He doesn't have time to waste on kids!
Go home!

00:06:45.076 --> 00:06:47.690
-Yes!
-Jimmy!

00:06:53.308 --> 00:06:58.040
Please tell him that kids from
Pony's home want to speak to him...

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.102
Jimmy, smile, smile!

00:07:03.927 --> 00:07:06.738
So you're filthy runts from Pony's home?

00:07:06.959 --> 00:07:08.111
Filthy?!

00:07:08.917 --> 00:07:10.871
Boss, smile, smile!

00:07:11.989 --> 00:07:16.570
Well, we may look a bit dingy
when compared to this estate...

00:07:16.748 --> 00:07:23.356
Maybe so! So what business do such dingy
kids have in beautiful Cartwright's estate?

00:07:23.554 --> 00:07:28.337
From next year, mr. Cartwright is going to
become a first cattle herder in this area!

00:07:28.584 --> 00:07:29.961
First one?

00:07:30.428 --> 00:07:34.593
If that happens, those meadows will be
completely overrun by cows!

00:07:46.876 --> 00:07:48.996
You'd better get out before that happens!

00:07:49.031 --> 00:07:53.955
Mr. Cartwright warned you, since
he's so nice! Right, kiddies?

00:07:54.227 --> 00:07:58.305
What do you mean, "nice"? Jimmy,
we are going to see mr. Cartwright.

00:07:58.821 --> 00:08:01.768
Hey, wait!
Get out, now!

00:08:02.834 --> 00:08:05.164
If you don't get out,
I'll throw you out myself!

00:08:21.638 --> 00:08:23.262
What's all that noise?

00:08:25.313 --> 00:08:27.757
Throw out those two kids!

00:08:32.079 --> 00:08:34.254
-Now they're angry at us, Jimmy!
-Okay!

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.788
-Wait!
-They're going towars the barn!

00:08:44.591 --> 00:08:45.789
Surround the barn!

00:08:53.622 --> 00:08:57.906
-Damn it, we have to catch the horses!
-Hey, wait!

00:08:59.809 --> 00:09:01.190
This is great!

00:09:03.771 --> 00:09:06.096
Now, Jimmy, let's find mr. Cartwright...

00:09:06.217 --> 00:09:10.361
Huh? Jimmy?
Where'd he go... Jimmy!

00:09:25.958 --> 00:09:27.151
Mr. Hoittman?

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:32.412
No, it couldn't be him.

00:09:33.273 --> 00:09:37.329
But... he looks just mr. Hoittman...
the gardener at Leagan's estate.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:39.099
He looks exactly like him from the back!

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:43.685
The kind mr. Hoittman
who worked together with Anthony.

00:09:49.223 --> 00:09:51.826
Maybe he is Cartwright's gardener?

00:09:53.204 --> 00:09:54.777
Hello, young lady.

00:09:55.049 --> 00:09:57.402
Aren't you cold like that, mister?

00:09:57.605 --> 00:10:02.272
Nah, it's not a big deal. I'm working
here to protect the trees from cold.

00:10:05.747 --> 00:10:08.395
Young lady, where are you from?

00:10:09.678 --> 00:10:11.866
I'm a widow from Pony's home!

00:10:13.639 --> 00:10:16.031
A widow? That's a good one!

00:10:18.534 --> 00:10:24.347
By the way, mister, I came here to speak
to mr. Cartwright... can I see him?

00:10:24.929 --> 00:10:28.946
So why did you come all the way
here to see him?

00:10:29.944 --> 00:10:33.052
Because mr. Cartwright is
a greedy old cheapskate!

00:10:34.038 --> 00:10:36.248
A greedy old cheapskate?

00:10:37.873 --> 00:10:40.830
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Believe it or not, but this series
was never released on a DVD.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.179
A greedy old cheapskate?

00:10:44.057 --> 00:10:47.540
That's right! He wants to drive out
the children from Pony's home,

00:10:47.575 --> 00:10:49.723
and build a huge farm in its place!

00:10:50.167 --> 00:10:52.236
I was raised at Pony's home.

00:10:52.491 --> 00:10:55.781
To all abandoned children, Pony's home
is their homeland!

00:10:56.149 --> 00:10:59.487
If that house disappears...
if that hill disappears...

00:11:00.865 --> 00:11:04.209
Mr. Cartwright doesn't think of
the children!

00:11:04.461 --> 00:11:06.030
Mister, don't you think so, too?

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:08.148
Hey, don't you think so?

00:11:08.183 --> 00:11:12.089
He has so much land and yet, he's a
greedy old cheapskate!

00:11:12.339 --> 00:11:13.598
You're hurting me!

00:11:13.695 --> 00:11:17.189
I'm sorry! Anyway, I have to
talk to him.

00:11:17.224 --> 00:11:19.958
I'll get him to understand
the issue with Pony's home.

00:11:20.142 --> 00:11:22.352
Don't get so angry...

00:11:24.399 --> 00:11:27.952
If he still doesn't understand,
mr. Cartwright isn't human!

00:11:28.155 --> 00:11:30.523
He's nothing but a hideous monster!

00:11:31.627 --> 00:11:32.558
There he goes!

00:11:34.635 --> 00:11:36.748
-Help!
-Wait!

00:11:36.915 --> 00:11:37.796
Jimmy!

00:11:37.976 --> 00:11:39.606
Boss!

00:11:40.703 --> 00:11:43.313
Where did you go?
Run for it!

00:11:43.822 --> 00:11:46.798
Mr. Cartwright! What should
we do with them?

00:11:48.195 --> 00:11:49.486
Uh, they are...

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.149
Mr. Cartwright?
Him?

00:11:56.226 --> 00:11:59.907
That's me, a greedy old cheapskate,
Cartwright!

00:11:59.942 --> 00:12:05.216
I'm so sorry! I had no idea who you are...

00:12:05.251 --> 00:12:07.118
I said a terrible thing...

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:12.476
But you looked so kind, the exact
opposite of a greedy old cheapskate!

00:12:13.233 --> 00:12:14.218
I'm sorry!

00:12:14.751 --> 00:12:17.822
-Run for it!
-Boss!

00:12:17.857 --> 00:12:20.063
-Stop! I'm gonna fire!
-No!

00:12:32.411 --> 00:12:38.034
It's all over now. I wanted to be strong
like sister Pony and sister Lane...

00:12:44.688 --> 00:12:46.965
Mr. Cartwright must be mad.

00:12:47.353 --> 00:12:52.686
Even though this happened... sister Pony
and sister Lane will try to speak to him again.

00:12:53.228 --> 00:12:55.853
Candy, you idiot!
Doing such a stupid thing...

00:12:57.121 --> 00:12:58.511
Stupid, stupid!

00:12:58.599 --> 00:13:00.444
Jimmy, it wasn't your fault.

00:13:01.041 --> 00:13:04.657
But... I provoked them...

00:13:09.439 --> 00:13:11.972
-That kid!
-Wait!

00:13:14.447 --> 00:13:18.374
And while they were going after me...
...I ran into you, boss.

00:13:20.488 --> 00:13:21.806
I'm so sorry!

00:13:25.351 --> 00:13:28.742
We can't leave it like this...
I'll have to apologize to him.

00:13:28.777 --> 00:13:32.302
Candy! Candy!
Come to teacher's room!

00:13:32.318 --> 00:13:33.619
Yes!

00:13:35.249 --> 00:13:38.336
Sister Lane is mad because of
what I did...

00:13:48.634 --> 00:13:50.002
Come in!

00:13:52.525 --> 00:13:56.619
Candy, look at all the presents.
Please help us out!

00:13:56.949 --> 00:13:57.874
Yes, teacher.

00:13:59.664 --> 00:14:03.244
She isn't mad. Mr. Cartwright
didn't tell her anything.

00:14:10.709 --> 00:14:14.589
But why didn't he tell her
immediately?

00:14:14.662 --> 00:14:17.682
There's no way that he would stay
silent after I lashed out on him.

00:14:17.862 --> 00:14:20.993
Anyway, I have to return to
his house and apologize.

00:14:21.374 --> 00:14:24.372
And beg him once again...

00:14:24.972 --> 00:14:27.827
Sister Pony, sister Lane!

00:14:30.686 --> 00:14:34.409
Christmas tree is done!
Please come and see it!

00:14:34.526 --> 00:14:35.690
Okay!

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:46.747
You made it very well!

00:14:47.207 --> 00:14:49.322
Santa will be happy!

00:14:52.623 --> 00:14:55.443
How could anybody chase out
all these cute kids...

00:15:00.877 --> 00:15:01.615
That's it!

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:04.715
Jimmy!

00:15:05.762 --> 00:15:11.034
-Find out when will mr. Cartwright be at home.
-Okay!

00:15:14.021 --> 00:15:16.689
That's right... there is no other way.

00:15:25.519 --> 00:15:28.269
Sister Pony! Sister Pony!

00:15:31.013 --> 00:15:33.037
It's horrible! Sister Pony!

00:15:33.236 --> 00:15:35.166
What's the matter, sister Lane?

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.793
All children are gone!

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:39.880
What?

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:45.428
-Candy! Candy!
-Jimmy!

00:15:57.391 --> 00:16:00.084
-You all have your stuff?
-Yes!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:03.368
-You'll put that on for Christmas!
-Yes!

00:16:11.477 --> 00:16:13.996
Jimmy, it's true what you said, right?

00:16:14.441 --> 00:16:19.049
I hid and heard everything!
Tommorow, cowboys will have a day off!

00:16:19.088 --> 00:16:20.717
A great time to come to their place!

00:16:20.789 --> 00:16:23.748
God, please let this turn out well.

00:16:39.811 --> 00:16:43.391
For mr. Cartwright and his new farm!
Cheers!

00:16:50.088 --> 00:16:53.389
Guys, you worked well this year!

00:16:53.827 --> 00:16:56.863
Now, I want you to return to your
homes and have a wonderful time!

00:16:57.598 --> 00:17:02.714
-I haven't been home so long...
-I want to see my kids...

00:17:03.112 --> 00:17:05.991
My brother will kill me if I don't
get him a present...

00:17:17.298 --> 00:17:19.349
What's that jingling sound...?

00:17:26.995 --> 00:17:29.183
It's coming from behind the Christmas tree...

00:17:43.095 --> 00:17:45.311
A present of angels!

00:18:10.823 --> 00:18:12.724
They will give you happiness...

00:18:13.203 --> 00:18:15.266
...and their kindness.

00:18:30.734 --> 00:18:32.299
Uh, mr. Cartwright...

00:18:32.731 --> 00:18:34.625
I'm really sorry for what happened
the other day.

00:18:35.264 --> 00:18:38.037
This is a Christmas present
from Pony's home.

00:18:38.241 --> 00:18:39.646
Will you accept it?

00:18:42.479 --> 00:18:46.936
These angels... all of them
are children from Pony's home?

00:18:47.893 --> 00:18:48.667
Yes.

00:18:58.464 --> 00:19:03.463
Anyway, I let you manage the
expansion of the farm, right?

00:19:03.498 --> 00:19:04.158
Yes.

00:19:04.578 --> 00:19:07.413
Leave Pony's home as it is, then.

00:19:07.627 --> 00:19:08.947
But...

00:19:09.329 --> 00:19:13.912
It's an order. If I chase out these
angels, I'm gonna roast in hell!

00:19:17.682 --> 00:19:18.980
Mr. Cartwright.

00:19:29.547 --> 00:19:30.687
Mr. Cartwright?

00:19:37.058 --> 00:19:38.367
Thank you.

00:19:39.593 --> 00:19:40.865
Thank you so much.

00:19:44.504 --> 00:19:49.647
I have a tomboyish daughter,
she is just like you.

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:54.897
Anyway, I've never got a present
as nice as this one!

00:20:05.541 --> 00:20:09.276
-Candy!
-Sister Pony, sister Lane!

00:20:11.146 --> 00:20:12.162
Candy!

00:20:12.654 --> 00:20:17.832
Pony's home is now going to stay
our homeland forever!

00:20:18.257 --> 00:20:22.688
-Yes, we heard.
-Candy, we owe it to you.

00:21:05.427 --> 00:21:09.334
It was a wonderful Christmas night to everyone.

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:11.791
Merry Christmas!

00:21:17.491 --> 00:21:20.170
To be continued.
